{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121940","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121940/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121940/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121940/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121940","id":5021187410,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74llkb","number":121940,"title":"Fix crash when setting the root Viewport's World3D to null","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-07-30T15:11:11Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T23:46:38Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T17:53:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121940","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121940.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121940.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-31T17:53:17Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nMost of the code in `Viewport::set_world_3d` already handles the world being null by explicitly checking `.is_valid()`:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (own_world_3d.is_valid() && world_3d.is_valid()) {\r\n\tworld_3d->disconnect_changed(callable_mp(this, &Viewport::_own_world_3d_changed));\r\n}\r\n\r\nworld_3d = p_world_3d;\r\n\r\nif (own_world_3d.is_valid()) {\r\n\tif (world_3d.is_valid()) {\r\n\t\town_world_3d = world_3d->duplicate();\r\n\t\tworld_3d->connect_changed(callable_mp(this, &Viewport::_own_world_3d_changed));\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\town_world_3d.instantiate();\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, this code did not:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\tRenderingServer::get_singleton()->viewport_set_scenario(viewport, find_world_3d()->get_scenario());\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis uses `find_world_3d()`, which would work if itself or an ancestor viewport had a World3D, but will return null if none exists, such as when setting a null World3D on the root viewport. This PR fixes the crash by checking if the found world exists, and setting a null RID for the scenario if it does not exist.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\tconst Ref<World3D> found_world = find_world_3d();\r\n\tif (found_world.is_valid()) {\r\n\t\tRenderingServer::get_singleton()->viewport_set_scenario(viewport, found_world->get_scenario());\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tRenderingServer::get_singleton()->viewport_set_scenario(viewport, RID());\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI did not use AI to make this pull request.\r\n\r\nThis is probably another good one to cherry-pick to supported branches.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121940/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}